msgid "Minimization of functions"
msgstr "函数的最小化"

msgid ""
"The minimization of general functions of one or more variables can be "
"carried out using the command:"
msgstr "一个或多个变量的通用函数的最小化可以使用以下命令执行："

msgid ""
"The optimization method, as well as finer control over *func*, can be chosen"
" using the ``METHOD`` directive"
msgstr "优化方法，以及对 *func* 的更精细控制，可以使用 ``METHOD`` 指令来选择"

msgid ""
"where *key* defines the optimization method. Valid options for *key* are:"
msgstr "其中 *key* 定义了优化方法。\\ *key* 的有效选项有："

msgid ""
"``BFGS`` Broyden-Fletcher-Goldfarb-Shanno conjugate gradient method, which "
"uses numerical gradients (default)"
msgstr "``BFGS`` Broyden-Fletcher-Goldfarb-Shanno 共轭梯度法，使用数值梯度（默认）"

msgid ""
"``SIMPLEX`` Downhill simplex method, which uses only function evaluations"
msgstr "``SIMPLEX`` 下山单纯形法，仅使用函数求值"

msgid "Options to these methods, *key1, key2, …*, are:"
msgstr "这些方法的选项 *key1, key2, …* 为："

msgid "Miscellaneous directives (separated by semicolons or linebreaks)"
msgstr "杂项指令（用分号或换行分隔）"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "Geometry optimization"
msgstr "几何优化"

msgid "Basis function optimizations"
msgstr "基函数优化"

msgid "Intersection points"
msgstr "交点"

msgid "``MINIMIZE, func, x$_1$[, x$_2$, x$_3$, …]``"
msgstr "``MINIMIZE, func, x$_1$[, x$_2$, x$_3$, …]``"

msgid ""
"where *func* represents a function of up to 50 variables *x:math:`_1`, "
"x:math:`_2`, …*. Two different optimization methods can be selected as "
"described below which do or do not use numerical derivative information."
msgstr ""
"其中 *func* 表示最多含 50 个变量 *x:math:`_1`, x:math:`_2`, …* "
"的函数。如下所述，可选择两种不同的优化方法，它们使用或不使用数值导数信息。"

msgid "``METHOD, key [, key1=value, key2=value, …] [minimize:method]``"
msgstr "``METHOD, key [, key1=value, key2=value, …] [minimize:method]``"

msgid "**``VARSCALE``\\ =\\ *vscale*** Optimization in space of scaled variables."
msgstr "**``VARSCALE``\\ =\\ *\\ vscale*** 在缩放变量空间中进行优化。"

msgid ""
"*vscale=0* no scaling (not recommended) *vscale=1* optimization in the space"
" of ln(:math:`x`) *vscale=2* optimization in space of initial value scaling,"
" e.g., :math:`x_1/x_{1i}` (default)"
msgstr ""
"*vscale=0* 不缩放（不推荐） *vscale=1* 在 ln(:math:`x`) 空间中进行优化 *vscale=2* "
"在初值缩放空间中进行优化，例如 :math:`x_1/x_{1i}`\\ （默认）"

msgid ""
"**``THRESH``\\ =\\ *thresh*** Required accuracy of either the gradient "
"(BFGS) or parameters (SIMPLEX). The default is :math:`1 \\cdot 10^{-4}` for "
"BFGS and :math:`1 \\cdot 10^{-2}` for SIMPLEX. Note that previously this "
"pertained to the function value in the Simplex case."
msgstr ""
"**``THRESH``\\ =\\ *\\ thresh*** 所需的梯度（BFGS）或参数（SIMPLEX）精度。BFGS 默认为 :math:`1"
" \\cdot 10^{-4}`\\ ，SIMPLEX 默认为 :math:`1 \\cdot 10^{-2}`\\ 。请注意，此前在 Simplex "
"情形下这是指函数值的精度。"

msgid ""
"**``VSTEP``\\ =\\ *epsd*** Step size for numerical gradients (BFGS) or "
"initial SIMPLEX vertices"
msgstr "**``VSTEP``\\ =\\ *\\ epsd*** 数值梯度（BFGS）或初始 SIMPLEX 顶点的步长"

msgid ""
"**``PROC``\\ =\\ *procname*** Specifies the procedure to be executed in each"
" optimization step. This defines a complete function evaluation (if needed, "
"numerical gradients will be evaluated using this procedure as well)"
msgstr ""
"**``PROC``\\ =\\ *\\ procname*** "
"指定在每个优化步长中要执行的过程。这定义了一次完整的函数求值（如有需要，数值梯度也将使用此过程求值）"

msgid ""
"**``STARTCMD``\\ =\\ *command*** Specifies a start command. In each "
"optimization step all input beginning with *command* to the current "
"``MINIMIZE`` is processed."
msgstr ""
"**``STARTCMD``\\ =\\ *\\ command*** 指定起始命令。在每个优化步长中，将处理当前 ``MINIMIZE`` 之前所有以"
" *\\ command* 开头的输入。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXIT``,\\ *maxit*** maximum number of optimization cycles. The default "
"is 30 for BFGS and 100 for SIMPLEX."
msgstr "**``MAXIT``,\\ *\\ maxit*** 优化循环的最大次数。BFGS 默认为 30，SIMPLEX 默认为 100。"

